professional-skills-tab = Skills and abilities
professional-skills-current-level = { $skill } · Level { $level }
professional-skills-experience-0 = You only know this field by hearsay. Complex work is best left to someone with training.
professional-skills-experience-1 = Your first lessons are behind you. You can handle the basics, but difficult tasks still call for a specialist.
professional-skills-experience-2 = Practice has built your confidence. Familiar work no longer requires constant guidance.
professional-skills-experience-3 = You have considerable experience. You handle equipment confidently and take on demanding work.
professional-skills-experience-4 = You know your trade inside out. Colleagues turn to you when ordinary knowledge is not enough.
