professional-skill-piloting-level-0 = Read navigation consoles; controls are unavailable.
professional-skill-piloting-level-1 = Pilot the ship in Drive mode. Brake, Stop and Cruise modes are unavailable.
professional-skill-piloting-level-2 = Full controls, braking and all movement modes.
professional-skill-piloting-level-3 = Full controls; a 75% chance to skip the existing collision consequences.
professional-skill-shooting-level-0 = Combat guns are unavailable. The holoflare gun needs no training.
professional-skill-shooting-level-1 = Pistols and light energy weapons: additional ±10° spread and a 10% random-direction misfire chance. Reload ship turrets.
professional-skill-shooting-level-2 = Additional ±5° weapon spread. No sidearm misfires; rifles, shotguns and SMGs have a 10% random-direction misfire chance.
professional-skill-shooting-level-3 = All weapons without skill penalties, including launchers and the M203. Operate ship gunnery.
professional-skill-medicine-level-0 = Ointment, bandages, blood packs and basic first aid.
professional-skill-medicine-level-1 = Syringes, medipens, hyposprays, sutures, regenerative mesh and health analyzers.
professional-skill-medicine-level-2 = Chemistry equipment and reagent identification. Apply treatments 15% faster.
professional-skill-medicine-level-3 = Treatments heal 15% more. Basic surgery: incisions, disinfection, suturing, amputations and glass removal.
professional-skill-medicine-level-4 = Full surgery, organ transplants and implants. All previous benefits.
professional-skill-engineering-level-0 = Basic tools are available but slower. Instant tool actions take 5 seconds.
professional-skill-engineering-level-1 = Advanced tools and structure construction. Everyday item crafting remains unrestricted.
professional-skill-engineering-level-2 = RCDs and atmospherics: pipes, canisters, vents and scrubbers.
professional-skill-engineering-level-3 = Build high-risk power systems: Tesla, singularity, TEG and AME.
professional-skill-salvage-level-0 = Pickaxes and ore bags. Grappling guns have an 80% random-direction misfire chance. No ore smelting.
professional-skill-salvage-level-1 = Crushers, glaives, PKAs, mining drills, basic mineral scanners and ore crates. Civilian ore processors; no grappling gun penalty.
professional-skill-salvage-level-2 = Standard ore processors and all previous abilities.
professional-skill-salvage-level-3 = Diamond drills, advanced mineral scanners and bluespace ore bags.
professional-skill-salvage-level-4 = Pilot Clarke mechs and use industrial ore processors.
professional-skill-botany-level-0 = Plant seeds and use basic tools with a 60% failure chance.
professional-skill-botany-level-1 = Fertilizers, seed extraction and no basic tool penalty.
professional-skill-botany-level-2 = Plant analysis and all previous abilities.
professional-skill-botany-level-3 = Detailed analysis, Left-4-Zed and unstable mutagen for breeding.
professional-skill-cooking-level-0 = Consume food and drinks. Cooking is unavailable.
professional-skill-cooking-level-1 = Simple dishes and drinks, including bread, sandwiches and coffee.
professional-skill-cooking-level-2 = Ordinary dishes and cocktails with few ingredients.
professional-skill-cooking-level-3 = All dishes and drinks, including complex recipes.
professional-skill-science-level-0 = Read previously collected data. No new scans or experiments.
professional-skill-science-level-1 = Scan anomalies and artifacts; activate artifacts.
professional-skill-science-level-2 = Generate anomalies and conduct research.
professional-skills-unknown-reagent = Unknown substance
professional-skills-botany-failure = You failed to tend the plant correctly.
